silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_03_olog_node_arrow_law_yoneda_hom_leg_4_P_owns silm:hasExample "In 'P1803_olog_node_arrow_lawYonedaHomLeg4', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, contravariant action P(owns): P(DomesticCat) -> P(Person) recovering Mittens' owner Alice" .
